            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 34:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA akaniambia, Jitwalie tena vyombo vya mchungaji mpumbavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana, tazama, mimi nitainua katika nchi hii mchungaji, ambaye hatawaangalia waliopotea, wala hatawatafuta waliotawanyika, wala hatamganga aliyevunjika, wala hatamlisha aliye mzima; bali atakula nyama ya wanono, na kuzirarua-rarua kwato zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.23.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 23:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole wake mchungaji asiyefaa, aliachaye kundi! Upanga utakuwa juu ya mkono wake, na juu ya jicho lake la kuume; mkono wake utakuwa umekauka kabisa, na jicho lake la kuume litakuwa limepofuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
